{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o182a","title":"司马炎为晋世子","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o182a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"司马炎为晋世子","evidence":["shaodi-e-o182a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0136","role":"受立","evidence":["shaodi-e-o182a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":264,"label":"冬十月丙午","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y264","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o171","basis":"冬十月丙午"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o182a-q","shaodi-q-o171","shaodi-q-o165","shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o182a-q","source_order":[4,892,"O182a"],"order":1307}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0136","name":"司马炎","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o182a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8505d0fdb1903174866b","layer":"original","quote":"丙午〖26〗，命抚军大将军、新昌乡侯炎，为晋世子〖27〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":299,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"shaodi-q-o171","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cef469d41ec5962b4e48","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年春正月，壬戌〖1〗，槛车征邓艾〖2〗。甲子〖3〗，行幸长安。壬申〖4〗，使使者以璧币祀华山〖5〗。是月，钟会反于蜀，为众所讨。邓艾亦见杀。二月，辛卯〖6〗，特赦诸在益土者。庚申〖7〗，葬明元郭后。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
